[[4,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Remove the car from the ramps.</p><p>Disconnect the battery negative terminal.</p><p><a href=\"#/2752386\">0010T84</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752536\">1088B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752410\">1008B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752408\">1008A47</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752826\">4450B04</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752641\">1092G11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752554\">1092A12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752662\">2110A60</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752422\">1020A20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752572\">1032A12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752574\">1032C40</a></p><p>1. Undo the connectors (1a) and remove the timing chain lubrication\njet (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2064579.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[4,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the timing chain lubrication jet in\nplace and secure it using the connectors.</p><p><a href=\"#/2752574\">1032C40</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752572\">1032A12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752422\">1020A20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752662\">2110A60</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752554\">1092A12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752641\">1092G11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752826\">4450B04</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752408\">1008A47</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752410\">1008B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752536\">1088B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752376\">0010T11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752378\">0010T20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752386\">0010T84</a></p><p>Remove the car from the ramps.</p>"]]